{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDExLS0yMDE1L1N0cmVuZ3RoJTIwSW4lMjBOdW1iZXJzJTIwJTI4MjAxMiUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"Strength In Numbers","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/yjxxE1d0cwDPcQtDBH4T8Mkz4aL.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ywMSp4OvSOQnobs8oD6DVHeXvjP.jpg","description":"Viewed at a distance, the world of mountain biking is a disjointed network of seemingly similar but disconnected communities. Freeride. Downhill. Big Mountain. All Mountain. Dirt Jump. Slopestyle. A sport of individuals, equally defined by their many differences, as the common threads that bind. And while our story doesn't follow a straight line, we all end up in the same place. Tire to ground, foot to pedal, hand to bar – communities drawn together by trails of dirt.","releaseInfo":"2012","genres":["Documentary","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"4.4","cast":["Andrew Shandro","Anthony Messere","Adam Billinghurst","Brandon Semenuk","Cam McCaul","Gee Atherton","Graham Agassiz","Matt Hunter"],"director":["Darcy Wittenburg","Darren McCullough"],"released":"2012-05-24T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Andrew Shandro"},{"name":"Anthony Messere"},{"name":"Adam Billinghurst"},{"name":"Brandon Semenuk","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/hFYWD6dXhhVdqtDvzY50PsW15Hc.jpg"},{"name":"Cam McCaul","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/sNq6Fv2aeQmG3fYi345Vt7zqzmM.jpg"},{"name":"Gee Atherton","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/m5AT5J5RPClJQXfDB6LpWsgSmZT.jpg"},{"name":"Graham Agassiz"},{"name":"Matt Hunter"},{"name":"Rene Wildhaber"},{"name":"Thomas Vanderham"}]},"trailers":[{"source":"xORYfLLZck8","type":"Trailer"}],"trailerStreams":[{"title":"Trailer","ytId":"xORYfLLZck8"}]}}